  "output": "collect:      3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6\ncollect_list: 3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6\ncollect_set:  3, 1, 4, 5, 9, 2, 6\npartition:    even 4, 2, 6, odd 3, 1, 1, 5, 9\ngroup_by:     small 3, 1, 4, 1, 2\ngroup_by:     large 5, 9, 6\n",
